title: AI agent health and telemetry
agents: linux
catalog: applications
license: MIT
distribution: forge_agents
description:
 This check discovers one service per configured agent and stable instance alias.
 It evaluates reported liveness, readiness, required dependencies and heartbeat
 age independently of host process checks. Optional bounded numeric telemetry
 provides work backlog, verification outcomes, latency, source freshness, usage
 and reconciliation counts. Missing required measurements are UNKNOWN, never zero.
 All measurements are gauges or rolling-window counts, not lifetime counters.
 Central Checkmk rules own thresholds. No secret access, LLM calls or remediation.
item:
 Agent/instance alias, for example jarvis/primary.
discovery:
 One service for each configured identity, including unavailable producers.
 Empty or malformed sections create a collector transport service in UNKNOWN.
